    <title>Vol.12 当代独居show time | 嘉宾：水母</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67066cb66c7f817786d39d9f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67066cb66c7f817786d39d9f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Oct 2024 11:44:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>独居，是独处的惬意生活，</span></p><span></span><p><span>是偶尔精致的一人食，</span></p><span></span><p><span>也是对朋友相聚的期待。</span></p><span></span><p><span>是拥有私人空间与更自由的生活，</span></p><span></span><p><span>也是一些小小的困惑</span></p><span></span><p><span>独居要做哪些准备？</span></p><span></span><p><span>真实的独居生活与想象中的存在多少差异？</span></p><span></span><p><span>暂居地是否被当作另一个温暖的家……</span></p><span></span><p><span>独自生活喜乐自得，它并不意味着孤独，而是五味缤纷。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我们邀请了配音演员水母做客，聊一聊她的独居体验～</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你也独立自由，亲友常伴，不惧独行，</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么，准备好接下来的生活旅行了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>配音演员：水母（wb@欢脱的小水母）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>金喵儿（wb@不吃素的金喵儿）</span></p><span></span><p><span>干干（wb@干干变有钱）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目策划】姜迟</span></p><span></span><p><span>【后期制作】干干</span></p><span></span><p><span>【播客题字】阿予</span></p><span></span><p><span>【封面设计】阻雪、仓咲鼠</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Paul Partohap - WANDERLUST</span></p><span></span><p><span>银河快递 - 等等 (Wait）</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈绮贞 - 台北某个地方</span></p><span></span><p><span>魏诗莹 - Make your world shine</span></p><span></span><p><span>黄妍 - 广州有雨</span></p><span></span><p><span>【互动方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@光阴之极Times</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作可发邮件至pole712@qq.com或微博私信</span></p>]]></description>
