    <title>Vol.09 与你同行 | 嘉宾：深语</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6666c11063c334a2fb816583</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6666c11063c334a2fb816583</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Jun 2024 09:02:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>生活是自己的旅程，又无时无刻不与人同行，父母、伴侣、师友，乃至陌生人，我们在与他们的相处中，重识自己，理解过去，珍视当下。而每一次体会，都是送给未来的礼物。本期播客我们邀请配音演员深语，分享了她的经历、体验，以及同内心和解的智慧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎关注“三更拌夜”，在夜的静谧中，遇见自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>金喵儿（wb@不吃素的金喵儿）</span></p><span></span><p><span>干干（wb@干干变有钱）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>深语：配音演员（wb@camile是深语）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a>嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a>快问快答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">07:58</a>能量值很高的深语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a>关于旅行的计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a>从e人变成i人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="986">16:26</a>对自己过于自责</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">17:12</a>与自己的和解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a>前期的困难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1272">21:12</a>现在的我很快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1517">25:17</a>父母的自豪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a>家人的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1923">32:03</a>新作品见面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1968">32:48</a>遇到录不出来的角色就自己演一段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">35:10</a>不要太在意外界的声音，做好自己就好了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2366">39:26</a>互动问答：谈一谈对《三更拌夜》这个节目的看法和对两位主持人的印象</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈婧霏 - In Bloom</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈婧霏 - 晕船记</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈婧霏 - 今晚</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈婧霏 - 生活在别处</span></p><span></span><p><span>【文案编辑】姜迟</span></p><span></span><p><span>【后期制作】干干</span></p><span></span><p><span>【播客题字】阿予</span></p><span></span><p><span>【封面设计】阻雪、仓咲鼠</span></p><span></span><p><span>【互动方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@光阴之极Times</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作可发邮件至pole712@qq.com或微博私信</span></p>]]></description>
