    <guid isPermaLink="false">663e256d0fcd82a7c9df0317</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 10 May 2024 13:47:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人生长路，有自己，有亲人，有朋友。许多人与我们同行，一路相伴。相遇、告别、重逢，万般体验，缺一不可。生命没有终点，沿途的风景使我们流连，爱与宽容温暖内心。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最新一期“三更拌夜”已上线，我们邀请了配音演员清鸢做客节目，一起聊一聊生活中的陪伴。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎关注“三更拌夜”，在夜的静谧中，遇见自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>金喵儿（wb@不吃素的金喵儿）</span></p><span></span><p><span>干干（wb@干干变有钱）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>清鸢：配音演员（wb@一只_鸢）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a>嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="97">01:37</a>快问快答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">06:02</a>为什么想要成为武则天？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a>离开自己的舒适区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="504">08:24</a>配音演员清鸢“重新出发”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="691">11:31</a>如何让家人对自己的职业改观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="965">16:05</a>本期主题“陪伴”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a>喜欢独处还是喜欢出去？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a>最近的作品分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a>对养老院的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1875">31:15</a>生活中的牵绊有哪些？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1928">32:08</a>陪伴是哪一种味道？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2175">36:15</a>陪伴自己最久的还是自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2265">37:45</a>分享给听众的解压的方式：不管发生什么，你不还是你吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2493">41:33</a>互动问答：在哪个瞬间你觉得自己长大了？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>蓝