    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从幕后再次回到台前，她携着时光的磨砺，重新迎接听众的注视。这几年的沉淀与探索，让她更加体会到幕前幕后并非相隔甚远，而是一体两面，互相辉映。本期节目，我们邀请砾小蔓来聊一聊台前幕后的那些经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>金喵儿（wb@不吃素的金喵儿）</span></p><span></span><p><span>干干（wb@干干变有钱）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>砾小蔓：配音演员（wb@砾小蔓）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a> 快问快答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="716">11:56</a> 每个人的改变是源于自己的欲望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a> 进入配音的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 幕后工作经历分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1711">28:31</a> 对之后的规划与打算</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1918">31:58</a> 通过爱好去传递感性的那一面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1987">33:07</a> 古早录音方式与现在审美的适应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">38:42</a> 嘉宾推荐歌曲：解语花-天空之外</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2347">39:07</a> 喵儿总结</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Addict.,Rewind,Achex - I'm worried about you</span></p><span></span><p><span>Wrince - Inner Rotation</span></p><span></span><p><span>弱水WeakWaves - 朵（Everything Is You）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sam Ock - Keep Me Warm (Instrumental)</span></p><span></span><p><span>【编辑】姜迟</span></p><span></span><p><span>【后期制作】干干</span></p><span></span><p><span>【播客题字】阿予</span></p><span></span><p><span>【封面设计】阻雪、仓咲鼠</span></p><span></span><p><span>【互动方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@光阴之极Times</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作可发邮件至pole712@qq.com或微博私信</span></p>]]></description>
