    <title>Vol.05 平衡兴趣与工作 | 嘉宾：苏流西</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/655f5f2dd0028fb4cb9933f2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">655f5f2dd0028fb4cb9933f2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 Nov 2023 14:18:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在繁忙的工作之余，兴趣爱好成为放松心灵、找到平衡的一片静谧角落。生活因为这份兴趣变得更加丰富多彩，本期节目，我们邀请到苏流西，来聊一聊如何平衡兴趣与工作。</span><br><span>【本期主播】</span><br><span>金喵儿（wb@不吃素的金喵儿）</span><br><span>干干（wb@干干变有钱）</span><br><span>【本期嘉宾】</span><br><span>苏流西：配音演员、广播剧制作人（wb@_苏世独立_横而不流）</span><br><span>【时间轴】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 快问快答</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="254">04:14</a> 也是一个潜在的赌徒 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="439">07:19</a> 当兴趣爱好成为工作和生活？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a> 怎么接触到配音的？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 有考虑过转行</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="867">14:27</a> 如何度过倦怠期、徘徊期</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a> 工作就是硬撑！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1481">24:41</a> 平衡工作与兴趣</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 清楚自己的极限在哪里</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1804">30:04</a> 如何平衡需要自己慢慢去探索</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1928">32:08</a>把握好现在自己所拥有的更重要</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">34:55</a>这是我希望自己达到的一个状态</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2404">40:04</a> 互动问答：你会做一个大家都喜欢的人还是自己喜欢的人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2496">41:36</a> 嘉宾推荐歌曲：Sam Ock,Jinnie - I Still Want Your Love (feat. Jinnie)</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2513">41:53</a> 喵儿总结 </span><br><span>【本期音乐】</span><br><span>Michael FK - Ascent</span><br><span>Ólafur Arnalds - Saudade (When We Are Born)</span><br><span>ACIDMAN - 赤橙 (Acoustic)</span><br><span>Hania Rani,Ólafur Arnalds - Whispering House</span><br><span>Audiomachine - All That We Are</span><br><span>【编辑】姜迟</span><br><span>【后期制作】干干</span><br><span>【播客题字】阿予</span><br><span>【封面设计】阻雪、仓咲鼠</span><br><span>【互动方式】</span><br><span>微博@光阴之极Times</span><br><span>商务合作可发邮件至pole712@qq.com或微博私信</span></p>]]></description>
