    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在梦想的彼岸，我们追逐着心中那颗闪烁的星。每一次的发声，都是对梦想的呼唤，每一次的演绎，都是青春的回响，本期节目中，我们与倾司畅聊配音的二三事，分享音频背后的秘密。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>金喵儿（wb@不吃素的金喵儿）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>倾司：配音演员（wb@楼倾司）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 快问快答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="303">05:03</a> 不管是以前还是以后都希望身边的人快乐健康</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 我们今天的主题是配音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="637">10:37</a> 入行的经验分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a> 游戏配音与其他配音方式的异同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 配音练习方向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1084">18:04</a> 关于表演：情绪处理的准备工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1527">25:27</a> “0”和“1”都可以！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1695">28:15</a> 录制中发生过的印象深刻的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 成为配音演员会影响怎样的生活习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2417">40:17</a> 互动问答：世界末日，外面都是丧尸，是选择躲在家里还是出去闯一条生路？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2504">41:44</a> 喵儿总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2678">44:38</a> 谢谢富婆（比心）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>State Artefact - Undo Last Move</span></p><span></span><p><span>Monoman - Meditation Monoman</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tone Stith - Smoking In The Park (Paradise)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Gamma Skies - In Love</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nina Nesbitt - Summer Fling</span></p><span></span><p><span>庸俗救星Vulgar Savior - Marry Me</span></p><span></span><p><span>【编辑】姜迟</span></p><span></span><p><span>【后期制作】干干</span></p><span></span><p><span>【播客题字】阿予</span></p><span></span><p><span>【封面设计】阻雪、仓咲鼠</span></p><span></span><p><span>【互动方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@光阴之极Times</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作可发邮件至pole712@qq.com或微博私信</span></p>]]></description>
